Next, we prove that $\phi^X$ is Lipschitz continuous on $D(X)$ with constant $L(N-1)$ with respect to the $\ell^\infty$-norm on $\R^N$. Let us fix two capital levels $m,m^\prime \in D(X)$ and a bank $i \in [N]$. Without loss of generality, we assume that $\phi^X_i(m) \leq \phi^X_i(m^\prime)$. We claim that
