\]

From left to right, we can realize these three terms as the weight generating functions of order ideals of $\calP_{\frac{2}{2r + 1}}$ which (1) do not contain either element labeled 3, (2) contain the smaller but not the larger element labeled 3, and (3)  contain both elements labeled 3. When $d_{\frac01} = 1$, one can do a similar analysis. 
