    A more subtle dependency is as follows.  Consider the following six equations in $E_1$:
    \[(x_1^3, x_2^2),(x_1^3, x_3^2),(x_1^2x_2, x_2^2),(x_1^2x_2, x_3^2),(x_1^2x_3, x_2^2), (x_1^2x_3, x_3^2).\]
